rm Operator image(s) is complete and\n  shows no non-validated cryptographic library usage in the request path.\n- The operator deploys and reconciles the serving stack correctly on a\n  FIPS-enabled OpenShift cluster using validated crypto modules.\n- Existing operator behavior on non-FIPS clusters is unchanged by the crypto\n  module replacement (no functional regression).\n- A gating CI check fails a Platform Operator build that reintroduces\n  non-validated crypto usage, and passes the remediated builds.\n- The Platform Operator module inventory and FIPS test results are produced\n  in a form the compliance evidence package can consume.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- **HLR-1 (P0)**: Platform Operator's share of \"all serving-stack images run\n  correctly on FIPS-enabled clusters using validated crypto modules\".\n- **HLR-3 (P1, bundled)**: the CI FIPS-regression gating check for Platform\n  Operator builds. Bundled with the P0 remediation because it is an\n  enforcement deliverable over the same surfaces being converted — it shares\n  the builds and module-inventory data with the remediation and has no\n  independent user value over unconverted builds.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":39406,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b901be51241a67d5","agent_id":"a5e7f9a0dee6eb09e","session_id":"58d4774e-cbd2-4ab5-97a3-4f58877fb394","uuid":"0d0b442c-22bb-4a40-92b3-a760faf91be8","timestamp":"2026-10-26T11:19:13.009Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9013"}
